OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,CDelayed 'much-needed' social homes due 
OL,5,Cby Christmas                           
OL,6,GAlmost two years later than expected,  
OL,7,Ga social housing project will welcome  
OL,8,Gresidents in time for Christmas,       
OL,9,Gaccording to developers.               
OL,11,FHomes in Somerset, which manages       
OL,12,Fsocial housing on behalf of Somerset   
OL,13,FCouncil, has been working with         
OL,14,Fcontractor Classic Builders to deliver 
OL,15,F33 new one and two-bedroom flats on    
OL,16,Fthe Penlea House site in Bridgwater.   
OL,18,FThe first residents were due to move   
OL,19,Fin January 2025 but the project has    
OL,20,Ffaced a number of delays, including a  
OL,21,Fbreak-in in February.                  
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
