OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,CPeople who throw litter from cars to   
OL,5,Cface fines                             
OL,6,GPeople who drop litter from vehicles   
OL,7,Gcould face fines of up to #200 as a    
OL,8,Gcouncil asks people to submit dashcam  
OL,9,Gfootage.                               
OL,11,FCotswold District Council said it was  
OL,12,Fcracking down on the issue as it       
OL,13,Fspoiled the area's natural beauty,     
OL,14,Fcosted taxpayers' money to clear up    
OL,15,Fand could harm wildlife.               
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
