OL,4,CAsbestos warning after fire on         
OL,5,Cindustrial estate                      
OL,6,GFire crews have warned people living   
OL,7,Gnear an industrial estate to keep      
OL,8,Gtheir windows and doors closed         
OL,9,Gfollowing a fire in a building that    
OL,10,Gmay have contained toxic materials.    
OL,12,FAvon Fire and Rescue Service was       
OL,13,Fcalled to reports of a blaze at the    
OL,14,Fsite on Douglas Road in Kingswood, on  
OL,15,Fthe edge of Bristol, in the early      
OL,16,Fhours.                                 
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
