OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,CCoroner's concerns over delays after   
OL,5,Cbaby's death                           
OL,6,GA coroner has raised concerns about    
OL,7,Gambulance and medical delays after a   
OL,8,G19-day-old baby boy died from sepsis   
OL,9,Gand meningitis.                        
OL,11,FSixteen days after Ezrah Pollard's     
OL,12,Fbirth in March 2022 he became unwell   
OL,13,Fand was grizzly, not feeding and       
OL,14,Fhaving a foul nappy.                   
OL,16,FA Truro inquest heard he developed a   
OL,17,Ffever and a 111 call was transferred   
OL,18,Fto the South Western Ambulance Service 
OL,19,FTrust (SWAST) which said he needed an  
OL,20,Fambulance response which should have   
OL,21,Farrived within 18 minutes.             
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
